{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring that childhood feeling back \u2014 a small creature that depends on you, gently. Your <strong>desktop companion</strong> sits at the edge of the screen while you work, study, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It asks for simple care: food, water, bath, play, cleaning \u2014 and responds with tiny moods and animations that make everyday moments feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no heavy micromanagement: quick interactions, soothing vibes. As days pass, your pet <strong>grows</strong> and shows new behaviors. Leave it alone for too long, and it may <strong>get sick</strong> \u2014 or even <strong>pass away</strong>. The heart of the game is the bond you build: return, care, and watch happiness bloom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.mp4?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to daily care, you can also <strong>customize your companion and environment</strong> with adorable items that add even more charm and personality to your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you\u2019ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real companionship:</strong> always there, never in the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle care loop:</strong> subtle reminders, quick actions, stress-free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based growth:</strong> evolving stages and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; cute:</strong> soft, comforting atmosphere for everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful stakes:</strong> your attention truly matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legal note</strong><br>*\u201c<strong>Tamagotchi</strong>\u201d is a trademark of Bandai. This game is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Bandai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTA</strong><br>Like it? <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to stay in the loop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964530?t=1757037273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964530?t=1757037273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/376eb5f66eabca1a7eba7be8e0f6aa1210693c4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757037273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/376eb5f66eabca1a7eba7be8e0f6aa1210693c4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757037273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring that childhood feeling back \u2014 a small creature that depends on you, gently. Your <strong>desktop companion</strong> sits at the edge of the screen while you work, study, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It asks for simple care: food, water, bath, play, cleaning \u2014 and responds with tiny moods and animations that make everyday moments feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no heavy micromanagement: quick interactions, soothing vibes. As days pass, your pet <strong>grows</strong> and shows new behaviors. Leave it alone for too long, and it may <strong>get sick</strong> \u2014 or even <strong>pass away</strong>. The heart of the game is the bond you build: return, care, and watch happiness bloom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.mp4?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to daily care, you can also <strong>customize your companion and environment</strong> with adorable items that add even more charm and personality to your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.poster.avif?t=1757037273\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.webm?t=1757037273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you\u2019ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real companionship:</strong> always there, never in the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle care loop:</strong> subtle reminders, quick actions, stress-free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based growth:</strong> evolving stages and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; cute:</strong> soft, comforting atmosphere for everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful stakes:</strong> your attention truly matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legal note</strong><br>*\u201c<strong>Tamagotchi</strong>\u201d is a trademark of Bandai. This game is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Bandai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTA</strong><br>Like it? <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to stay in the loop.</p>","developers":["Chilly Kitty"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/00adf56b63140effb8ec5522f28e6362d8f45183/header.jpg?t=1757037273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Rec